# Vite build-time config for the UI (`web/`).
#
# Copy to `web/.env` (or set the same variable in the Vercel / Cloudflare Pages
# dashboard) and rebuild. Vite inlines these at build time, so a change needs a
# new build - they are not read at runtime.
#
# Base URL of the Rust API. Unset = requests stay relative (same-origin, no
# CORS), which is what the Rust binary serving `web/dist` wants. Set it when the
# UI is hosted on its own, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://example.com
# The API must then list the UI's origin in ALLOWED_ORIGIN, or the browser blocks
# the response.
#
# Nothing secret goes here: anything with a `VITE_` prefix is inlined into the JS
# bundle and is readable by every visitor.
VITE_API_BASE=
